<!DOCTYPE html>
<html dir="rtl" lang="ar">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>أنشئ متجرك مجاناً — دُكّان</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Kufi+Arabic:wght@400;600;700;800;900&family=Cairo:wght@400;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/site.css">
<style>
.auth-wrap{min-height:92vh;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:2rem 1.2rem;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0f172a 0%,#0c4a6e 50%,#134e4a 100%);position:relative;overflow:hidden;font-family:'Noto Kufi Arabic','Cairo',sans-serif}
.auth-wrap::before{content:'';position:absolute;width:500px;height:500px;border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(14,165,233,.12),transparent 70%);top:-200px;right:-100px}
.auth-wrap::after{content:'';position:absolute;width:400px;height:400px;border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(16,185,129,.08),transparent 70%);bottom:-150px;left:-80px}
.auth-card{background:#fff;border-radius:24px;padding:2.5rem;width:min(440px,100%);box-shadow:0 25px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.4);position:relative;z-index:1;animation:fadeInUp .5s}
@keyframes fadeInUp{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)}to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0)}}
.auth-card h1{font-size:1.5rem;font-weight:900;margin-bottom:.3rem;color:#0f172a;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.5rem}
.auth-card .sub{color:#64748b;font-size:.9rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem;line-height:1.7}
.auth-card label{display:block;font-size:.87rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:1rem;color:#334155}
.auth-card input[type="text"],.auth-card input[type="password"]{width:100%;padding:.75rem 1rem;border:1.5px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:12px;font-family:inherit;font-size:.95rem;margin-top:.3rem;transition:all .2s;background:#fafbfc}
.auth-card input:focus{outline:none;border-color:#0ea5e9;box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(14,165,233,.1);background:#fff}
.btn-main{width:100%;text-align:center;border:none;font-family:inherit;margin-top:.5rem;padding:.85rem;font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:800;border-radius:14px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0ea5e9,#0284c7);color:#fff;cursor:pointer;transition:all .25s;box-shadow:0 6px 16px rgba(14,165,233,.35)}
.btn-main:hover{filter:brightness(1.08);transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 10px 24px rgba(14,165,233,.45)}
.alert-err{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fee2e2,#fecaca);color:#991b1c;border:1.5px solid #fca5a5;padding:.75rem 1rem;border-radius:12px;font-size:.88rem;margin-bottom:1rem;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.5rem}
.cap-row{display:flex;gap:.7rem;align-items:center;margin-top:.3rem}
.cap-row input{flex:1}
.cap-q{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#eff6ff,#dbeafe);color:#1d4ed8;font-weight:800;padding:.75rem 1rem;border-radius:12px;font-size:1rem;white-space:nowrap;border:1.5px solid #bfdbfe}
.alt{text-align:center;margin-top:1.5rem;font-size:.88rem;color:#64748b}
.alt a{color:#0ea5e9;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none}
.alt a:hover{text-decoration:underline}
.hp{position:absolute;left:-9999px;opacity:0;height:0;overflow:hidden}
.alert-ref{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#dcfce7,#bbf7d0);color:#065f46;border:1.5px solid #86efac;padding:.75rem 1rem;border-radius:12px;font-size:.85rem;margin-bottom:1.2rem;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.5rem}
.auth-features{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:.6rem;margin:1.5rem 0;padding:1rem;background:#f8fafc;border-radius:14px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0}
.auth-feature{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.6rem;font-size:.85rem;color:#475569;font-weight:500}
.auth-feature svg{width:18px;height:18px;color:#10b981;flex-shrink:0}
.auth-back{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:.35rem;color:#0ea5e9;font-size:.85rem;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:1rem;padding:.35rem .6rem;border-radius:8px;background:#eff6ff;border:1px solid #bfdbfe;transition:all .2s}
.auth-back:hover{background:#dbeafe;transform:translateX(2px)}
</style>
</head>
<body class="site">
<header class="site-nav"><div class="site-nav-inner">
  <a class="brand" href="/"><b>دُكّان</b><span>Dukkan</span></a>
  <nav><a href="/">الرئيسية</a></nav>
  <div class="site-cta"><a class="btn-ghost" href="/login">دخول</a></div>
</div></header>
<div class="auth-wrap">
  <div class="auth-card">
    <a href="/" class="auth-back">→ رجوع للرئيسية</a>
    <h1>🚀 أنشئ متجرك مجاناً</h1>
    <p class="sub">دقيقة واحدة وتصير جاهز — بلا بطاقة دفع ولا خبرة تقنية</p>
    <% if (typeof trialDays !== 'undefined' && trialDays > 0) { %>
      <div class="alert-ref">🎁 سجل الآن واحصل على <b><%= trialDays %> أيام</b> احترافية مجاناً</div>
    <% } %>
    <% if (typeof ref !== 'undefined' && ref) { %>
      <div class="alert-ref">🎁 سُجلت عبر دعوة من متجر «<%= refName %>»</div>
    <% } %>
    <% if (error) { %><div class="alert-err">⚠️ <%= error %></div><% } %>
    <form method="post" action="/signup">
      <input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrf %>">
      <% if (typeof ref !== 'undefined' && ref) { %><input type="hidden" name="ref" value="<%= ref %>"><% } %>
      <label>اسم المتجر
        <input type="text" name="name" required placeholder="مثال: عطور الشام">
      </label>
      <label>اسم المستخدم (للدخول)
        <input type="text" name="username" required dir="ltr" placeholder="hmet-furniture">
      </label>
      <label>كلمة المرور
        <input type="password" name="password" required minlength="8" placeholder="8 أحرف على الأقل">
      </label>
      <label>رقم الهاتف (اختياري)
        <input type="text" name="phone" dir="ltr" placeholder="07XX XXX XXXX">
      </label>
      <label>أثبت أنك إنسان: <%= cap.a %> + <%= cap.b %> = ؟
        <div class="cap-row"><span class="cap-q"><%= cap.a %> + <%= cap.b %> =</span>
        <input type="text" name="answer" required autocomplete="off" inputmode="numeric" placeholder="الإجابة"></div>
      </label>
      <input type="text" name="website" class="hp" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off">
      <button type="submit" class="btn-main">أنشئ متجري الآن 🚀</button>
    </form>
    <div class="auth-features">
      <div class="auth-feature">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/></svg>
        <span>متجرك جاهز خلال 60 ثانية</span>
      </div>
      <div class="auth-feature">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
        <span>دفع آمن عند الاستلام</span>
      </div>
      <div class="auth-feature">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><rect x="1" y="3" width="15" height="13" rx="2"/><path d="M16 8h4l3 3v5h-7V8z"/><circle cx="5.5" cy="18.5" r="2.5"/><circle cx="18.5" cy="18.5" r="2.5"/></svg>
        <span>توصيل لكل المحافظات العراقية</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="alt">عندك حساب؟ <a href="/login">سجل الدخول</a></p>
  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
